Further, the release of the Petitioner shall also be the following terms and conditions:-
I. The Petitioner shall not threaten, harass or terrorize the Informant and her family members in any manner whatsoever;
II. he shall not tamper with the prosecution // 4 // evidence or try to threaten or influence the witnesses in any manner whatsoever;
III. he shall appear before the concerned Police Station as and when directed by the Investigating Officer to cooperate with the investigation; and IV. he shall appear before the trial court on each date of posting of the case.

